==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 5.33~20 seconds<sup>160f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~30.67 seconds<sup>400f~920f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As with all stages in this sub-chapter, Coral Coral Reef isn't very difficult. A simple lineup that could clear [[Propolis Oasis]] is all that is really necessary here.

==Trivia==
*Coral is both a color and an animal, so Coral Coral Reef's name is grammatically correct - it's a coral-colored coral reef.

